CONTENT IN THIS REPOSITORY
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

`songs/*/lyrics.txt` contains original lyrics written by the copyright
holder (with AI assistance, as recorded in each file's header). They are
covered by the same licence as the rest of the repository.

`songs/_template/empty_v196.svp` is an EMPTY Synthesizer V project — zero
notes, no musical content. It is included solely as a structural template
so the tooling knows the file schema. Every other `.svp`, `.wav`, `.mid`,
and `.flp` is excluded by `.gitignore` and is not distributed.
